sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Range continuation depends on representation identity
  accDescr: A retained abc prefix and If-Range A can lead to validated 206 def, or a full 200 after change; the full response cannot be appended to the old prefix.
participant C as Client
  participant O as Origin
  Note over C,O: Retained abc, strong ETag A
  C->>O: Range: bytes=3-<br/>If-Range: "A"
  alt Same representation, range honored
    O-->>C: 206, bytes 3-5/6<br/>def
    Note over C,O: Validate, then append
  else Representation changed
    O-->>C: 200, full new representation
    Note over C,O: Replace or restart<br/>Do not append full 200
  end
